    "question": "A 25-year-old woman presented with symptoms of jaundice, acute cholecystitis, and an enlarged spleen. On investigation, numerous gallstones were discovered. Review the following CBC results: {{table}} What follow-up laboratory test would provide valuable information for this patient?",
