    "section": "Microbiology and Parasitology Problem-Solving",
    "chapter": "Microbiology",
    "question": "Anaerobic gram-negative bacilli were recovered from fluid obtained from drainage of a postsurgical abdominal wound. The following test results were recorded: {{table}} What is the correct identification?",
